      "display_source": "Unchanged raw master with display-only white/cyan matte and nearest alpha; never game payload.",
      "reason": "Exact source, full raw04434ce1 and white/cyan/alpha views actually inspected: the painted rectangular background is now restored, but the lower face and neck continue as a long tapered yellow column to a narrow human-sized tall white collar. Give the mascot a COMPACT NEAR-ROUND head with a distinct curved lower chin and VERY SHORT BROAD neck transition; raise and broaden the existing collar and shoulder lines to meet that chin. Remove the extended exposed yellow stalk rather than merely painting a fold over it. Preserve the original swept brown hair, clean-shaven face, head angle/expression, black formal coat, high white collar, black bow tie, pale diagonal sash and actual original gold neck/shoulder ornaments. Retain the already restored opaque original painted backdrop, raw-HD detail, aspect ratio and source crop. No new frame, note, cream mascot bib, tie style or decoration.",
      "held_same_person_family_no_new_art_request": false
    }
